        "Ask anything. {ai} answers in the browser, signed in as you. For answers right here, choose a service below." = "Opýtaj sa na čokoľvek. {ai} odpovie v prehliadači s tvojím prihlásením. Pre odpovede priamo tu vyber dole inú službu."
